WEBVTT

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:09.770
Gauche... I wanna become 
a Letter Bee just like you!

00:00:14.590 --> 00:00:15.420
Gauche...

00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:25.050
I will now rob you of this letter as 
per my instructions from my client.

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:29.120
Thank you for your understanding.

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:35.900
G-Gauche!

00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:41.140
You're alive! You're actually alive, Gauche!

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:43.470
It's me, Lag Seeing!

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:46.650
You carried me as a letter five years ago!

00:00:46.970 --> 00:00:48.480
I'm Lag Seeing!

00:00:51.970 --> 00:00:53.150
You remember me, right?

00:00:59.230 --> 00:00:59.910
Gauche...

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:06.170
I-I wanted to be like you, 
so I became a Letter Bee.

00:01:06.820 --> 00:01:09.970
I finally became one, Gauche!

00:01:17.270 --> 00:01:19.300
Today is the first time we have met.

00:01:20.910 --> 00:01:24.790
It seems you have mistaken me for 
someone else, little Letter Bee.

00:01:25.620 --> 00:01:27.940
To claim that I was a 
Letter Bee is ridiculous.

00:01:28.220 --> 00:01:29.950
This shouldn't be! After all...

00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:31.190
Marauder.

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:32.930
Marauder?

00:01:33.810 --> 00:01:41.920
The job of you Bees' is to deliver, yes?
We Marauders' job is to steal.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:55.340
I am not a failure as a dingo!

00:01:55.640 --> 00:01:58.340
I became Lag's dingo, Niche!

00:01:58.790 --> 00:02:00.690
Lag has only one dingo, me!

00:02:02.590 --> 00:02:04.480
I do not understand you.

00:02:35.670 --> 00:02:36.190
Roda...

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:45.680
Gauche, you really did lose your heart.

00:02:46.050 --> 00:02:48.680
That's it! I met Sylvette!

00:02:49.070 --> 00:02:50.560
You remember Sylvette, right?

00:02:51.140 --> 00:02:54.470
Your precious little sister, 
Sylvette! Remember?

00:02:55.630 --> 00:02:57.910
I do not wish to do you any harm.

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:02.320
Farewell, little Letter Bee.

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:03.950
Wait, Gauche!

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:07.190
Sylvette's been waiting for you 
to come back this whole time!

00:03:07.630 --> 00:03:10.580
Go home! Go home to Sylvette!

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:12.250
And Aria...

00:03:13.060 --> 00:03:14.660
And Dr. Thunderland...

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:16.090
And Mana-san...

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:20.320
Everyone... Everyone is waiting 
for you to come back, Gauche!

00:03:25.240 --> 00:03:26.050
Gauche...

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:29.180
I am what is known as a Marauder.

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:31.700
My name is Noir.

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:36.770
I'm angry... I'll get you!

00:03:40.670 --> 00:03:42.900
You are very quick, but you 
rely on brute strength.

00:03:43.470 --> 00:03:46.380
Is that all one can expect 
from the blood of Maka?

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:47.560
That isn't all!

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:48.650
Just you wait!

00:03:49.050 --> 00:03:50.870
You'll leave your master undefended?

00:03:52.660 --> 00:03:56.750
Protecting one's master 
is everything for a dingo.

00:04:00.280 --> 00:04:03.510
A black Spirit Amber...

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:16.640
You really are a failure as a dingo.

00:04:23.090 --> 00:04:23.800
Lag!

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:32.210
Gauche...

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:34.640
Roda...

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:42.800
Farewell, Lag Seeing.

00:04:44.480 --> 00:04:45.240
No...

00:04:47.270 --> 00:04:48.930
Don't go...

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:55.640
No more...

00:04:57.460 --> 00:04:59.090
...goodbyes...

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:52.010
Inside us all, heart lies foremost.

00:06:53.120 --> 00:06:56.600
Heart is thy Lord,

00:06:57.440 --> 00:07:00.340
And thou art created from heart.

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:07.490
From Verse 1 of The Amberground Scriptures

00:07:16.960 --> 00:07:22.150
Promise

00:07:40.800 --> 00:07:42.770
You're that Bee's...

00:07:43.630 --> 00:07:46.520
Niche is Lag's dingo! Not a failure!

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:50.390
Get on. I'll take you two to the Bee Hive.

00:08:03.280 --> 00:08:03.920
What?

00:08:04.550 --> 00:08:05.550
Lag Seeing was what?

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:07.830
Quickly!

00:08:08.560 --> 00:08:09.580
Get him to the clinic, hurry!

00:08:10.410 --> 00:08:10.930
Right!

00:08:12.230 --> 00:08:14.600
Jiggy Pepper... What in blazes happened?

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:15.840
No clue.

00:08:16.940 --> 00:08:18.930
But I think the dingo knows something.

00:08:24.530 --> 00:08:26.980
They were opposed by something that 
could wound the child of Maka?

00:08:35.920 --> 00:08:36.810
Where am I?

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:38.950
Your hand.

00:09:02.650 --> 00:09:04.810
Who am I?

00:09:05.090 --> 00:09:06.560
It has been a while.

00:09:08.680 --> 00:09:09.310
Who are you?

00:09:09.820 --> 00:09:12.340
The one who was not able to become Spirit.

00:09:12.710 --> 00:09:15.380
I would have liked it if you called me that.

00:09:16.870 --> 00:09:18.830
But it seems you do not remember.

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:28.370
I am Lawrence.

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:38.810
And you, one of my Marauders, are named Noir.

00:09:44.970 --> 00:09:45.640
Gauche!

00:09:52.060 --> 00:09:52.710
Seeing...

00:09:55.260 --> 00:09:56.270
What was that?

00:09:57.100 --> 00:09:58.950
It seems you were shot with a shindan.

00:09:59.270 --> 00:09:59.990
A shindan?

00:10:01.460 --> 00:10:03.870
That really was Gauche...

00:10:04.320 --> 00:10:05.580
You met Suede?

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:11.240
Hey, Seeing...

00:10:17.640 --> 00:10:19.340
Gauche!

00:10:26.700 --> 00:10:30.370
This man called Noir, yes? 
I doubt there's any mistake.

00:10:30.830 --> 00:10:31.940
He is Gauche Suede.

00:10:33.130 --> 00:10:39.520
Gauche doesn't seem to remember 
anything. Not me. Not even Sylvette!

00:10:40.130 --> 00:10:44.160
I finally met him again, but I 
wasn't able to bring him back.

00:10:46.360 --> 00:10:48.280
I am so sorry, Aria-san...

00:10:49.110 --> 00:10:52.600
I'm sorry, Mana-san, Dr. Thunderland...

00:10:52.920 --> 00:10:55.400
There's no need to apologize, Seeing.

00:10:55.900 --> 00:10:57.840
This is great progress, don't you think?

00:10:58.130 --> 00:10:59.100
Progress?

00:10:59.100 --> 00:11:03.330
Marauders are paid to rob people of things.

00:11:03.960 --> 00:11:08.730
The past few years we've gotten report after 
report about letters being targeted by them.

00:11:09.300 --> 00:11:13.120
Odds are high the Marauder's clients
are a group named Reverse,

00:11:13.120 --> 00:11:15.560
searching for information on the
Amberground government.

00:11:16.260 --> 00:11:21.400
An anti-government organization that seeks 
to foster a revolution in Amberground?

00:11:21.760 --> 00:11:22.720
Yes, Doctor.

00:11:23.290 --> 00:11:25.510
There may well be a connection.

00:11:26.570 --> 00:11:28.410
We will surely have more chances 
to make contact with them.

00:11:28.820 --> 00:11:31.910
Until then, I will not be reporting 
this to the higher-ups.

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:36.300
Do not speak of this to 
anyone unless necessary.

00:11:52.120 --> 00:11:55.020
You really are a failure as a dingo.

00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:05.600
Lag!

00:12:07.400 --> 00:12:08.140
Niche...

00:12:08.140 --> 00:12:10.710
Lag, do you have a delivery? 
Are we going on a delivery?

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:14.440
No... They said I could go home for today.

00:12:15.390 --> 00:12:16.360
Oh...

00:12:17.330 --> 00:12:19.800
Tomorrow, then? Will we 
go on a delivery tomorrow?

00:12:20.990 --> 00:12:21.920
I'm not sure...

00:12:22.260 --> 00:12:25.960
As your dingo, I'll make sure 
to protect you next time, Lag!

00:12:26.480 --> 00:12:28.090
Yeah... Thank you.

00:12:32.240 --> 00:12:32.910
Lag!

00:12:34.110 --> 00:12:37.980
A girl believed to be a dingo, 
and a black Spirit Amber...

00:12:38.840 --> 00:12:41.810
The report from the capital 
said it was confiscated, but...

00:12:44.100 --> 00:12:45.310
Are you okay, Aria-kun?

00:12:46.170 --> 00:12:47.790
Leaving him like this...

00:12:50.020 --> 00:12:51.660
No, I am not, Master!

00:12:53.600 --> 00:12:56.220
Please check this paperwork in my place.

00:12:57.100 --> 00:12:59.130
And these, and these, and also these.

00:12:59.520 --> 00:13:00.430
If you'll excuse me.

00:13:09.780 --> 00:13:10.430
Lag!

00:13:11.640 --> 00:13:13.380
Will we go on a delivery 
the day after tomorrow?

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:14.880
I don't know.

00:13:14.880 --> 00:13:16.730
Then what about the day after 
the day after tomorrow?

00:13:20.310 --> 00:13:23.940
I have to tell Sylvette about Gauche...

00:14:09.460 --> 00:14:11.620
Lag, aren't you hungry?

00:14:12.060 --> 00:14:12.780
Yeah...

00:14:12.780 --> 00:14:13.780
Should I grill Steak?

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:20.340
Steak... Will you grill up nice and yummy?

00:14:26.980 --> 00:14:29.290
You'll be eaten by Lag, so be proud!

00:14:29.570 --> 00:14:30.460
Steak!

00:14:34.030 --> 00:14:34.540
Lag!

00:14:47.280 --> 00:14:47.910
Lag...

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:08.340
I wonder how Sylvette will take it?

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:11.260
I bet she'll be really sad...

00:15:12.550 --> 00:15:14.690
To think I'm sleeping in Gauche's room...

00:15:14.690 --> 00:15:16.580
It's all kind of surreal.

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:19.910
But I'll take you up on your offer, Sylvette.

00:15:21.240 --> 00:15:25.170
Until the day I find Gauche 
and bring him back here.

00:15:29.410 --> 00:15:33.980
After saying that... I'm so useless.

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:38.330
I'm sorry, Sylvette...

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:49.280
Surprise!

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:52.800
Welcome home, Lag!

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:55.800
What in the world...

00:15:56.540 --> 00:15:58.220
I heard everything from Aria-san.

00:16:00.090 --> 00:16:01.850
That's why we're having a celebration, Lag!

00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:03.350
A celebration?

00:16:04.550 --> 00:16:06.280
To celebrate you meeting my brother.

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:10.800
A celebration? But I...

00:16:13.270 --> 00:16:16.840
But I couldn't...

00:16:17.340 --> 00:16:19.070
You damn Monsieur Criesalot!

00:16:19.490 --> 00:16:20.370
Monsieur?

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:25.260
A crybaby! You really are 
even worse than me, Lag!

00:16:25.730 --> 00:16:26.830
Sylvette...

00:16:27.110 --> 00:16:29.060
Lag, you told me before, right?

00:16:29.750 --> 00:16:32.740
That you'd become a Bee 
and search for my brother.

00:16:33.720 --> 00:16:34.070
Yeah...

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:37.340
And you kept your promise!

00:16:39.700 --> 00:16:41.500
I'm happy.

00:16:42.340 --> 00:16:43.960
My brother is alive.

00:16:44.680 --> 00:16:46.690
And to find out in such a short time...

00:16:52.550 --> 00:16:54.530
Thank you, Lag.

00:16:55.780 --> 00:16:57.350
Sylvette...

00:16:57.950 --> 00:17:00.110
I believe in you, Lag.

00:17:01.030 --> 00:17:03.850
No... It's because of you that I can believe.

00:17:04.840 --> 00:17:08.090
Because you were so important to my brother.

00:17:10.400 --> 00:17:15.280
You are no longer a letter... 
You're a man now, Lag Seeing.

00:17:16.280 --> 00:17:20.390
So... we're friends now?

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:22.060
Yes.

00:17:24.120 --> 00:17:25.390
Friends...

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:30.320
You told me you would bring 
back his heart, remember?

00:17:32.000 --> 00:17:33.790
So I know that, one day...

00:17:35.050 --> 00:17:41.390
We'll be able to have an even bigger 
party with my brother and everyone...

00:17:43.190 --> 00:17:45.980
I believe in that!

00:17:46.800 --> 00:17:48.410
Sylvette...

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:52.060
You're amazing, Sylvette... I promise...

00:17:52.060 --> 00:17:53.420
So...

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:57.670
Don't cry, Sylvette!

00:17:57.670 --> 00:18:00.830
You really are a big crybaby!

00:18:00.830 --> 00:18:03.970
You're one to talk, Lag!

00:18:06.790 --> 00:18:08.520
I promise, Sylvette.

00:18:09.590 --> 00:18:13.320
I will deliver Gauche's heart to you.

00:18:14.790 --> 00:18:18.520
Yes... Because I am a Letter Bee!

00:18:21.480 --> 00:18:24.800
They're pretty alike. I 
think they're a good match.

00:18:24.800 --> 00:18:27.130
You mustn't, Sub Master!

00:18:27.730 --> 00:18:30.060
If you say that, Niche will get jealous...

00:18:30.870 --> 00:18:31.370
Huh?

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:34.460
Lag, where's Niche?

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:37.090
Huh? She hasn't come home yet?

00:18:37.820 --> 00:18:39.000
How's it goin'?

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:41.890
Oh, good. Came in time for some grub.

00:18:42.640 --> 00:18:43.590
Zazie...

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:47.140
What're these things that 
were left outside the door?

00:18:47.990 --> 00:18:49.590
Outside the door?

00:18:51.120 --> 00:18:52.350
Lag, those are...

00:18:54.420 --> 00:18:56.240
Niche's underwear!

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:08.420
I am a failure as Lag's dingo.

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:12.450
I have lost the right to 
wear Lag's underwear.

00:19:26.160 --> 00:19:40.960
Next: Underwear and Bread
